          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cannot reach the server: a host route points to a gateway that is gone. Try once more; if it still fails, look for a UGHS route to the server IP with netstat -rn -f inet." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法连接服务器：本机有一条指向失效网关的主机路由。请重试一次；若仍失败，用 netstat -rn -f inet 查看指向服务器 IP 的 UGHS 路由。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
